# phinx schema-dump cache — regenerable, one per Datasources connection
# (api/config/Migrations/schema-dump-<connection>.lock). phinx rewrites it on
# every `migrate`; tracking it just churns every schema-changing commit. The
# `default` one was first committed by accident in 5fb4563 and un-tracked here.
api/config/Migrations/schema-dump-*.lock
